<title>USA: Ultimate names J. Edward McEntire CEO.</title>
<headline>Ultimate names J. Edward McEntire CEO.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ultimate Electronics Inc said on Thursday that it named J. Edward McEntire as chief executive.</p>
<p>He succeeds William Pearse, who will continue as chairman, the company said in a news release.</p>
<p>McEntire previously was vice president of operations.</p>
<p>David Workman continues to serve as president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Ultimate Electronics is a specialty retailer of home entertainment and consumer electronics products.</p>
</text>
